-10-06T23:51:10Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-06T23:51:10Z"},"message":"DetachableJoint: add initial_attach SDF parameter (#3268) (#4045)\n\nAdd an optional `initial_attach` parameter to the DetachableJoint system\nthat controls whether the joint starts attached or detached when the\nsimulation starts. It defaults to `true`, preserving existing behavior.\n\nThe parameter is read before the attach/detach subscribers are created,\nso an attach request received during startup is not overwritten.\n\nAlso add the InitialAttachFalse integration test and test world models.\n\nCloses #3021\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code (Claude Opus 5.5, Anthropic)\n\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 6501b14956d873409d6945acf7530e3977a94d72)\n\nSigned-off-by: SurafelAnshebo <surafelrtesfaye@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Surafel <25456347+SurafelAnshebo@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>","tree":{"sha":"e7004d39145d4e709cc99982f6d7bec1f2a6c373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/trees/e7004d39145d4e709cc99982f6d7bec1f2a6c373"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/git/commits/2cd73296ad1bcbf3d8a2bfec1b45f59e6598638c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxYluCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAadoQAJYSGf9hvygJi6Rm2gsgCPsw\nUF0waCbwa0X90noAENK7QheQ/OWiWLwvKxgpB2j3fh1240rKHmg3TMZtOrtdq9kK\nAntjyjjUNrZL0qG13aZAJokiYE0mBEAsJgpNZdrLZm3yRL+04JRq6v1gHyrxc2YC\nuZ+Fm6Pbs61F7UyjzzgbizQzcRvvUehEVfRE2HuLX8+k/YGkGwyCS1bvuia7j5UA\nxUpuOEVFhAVsttjoFXAd/AlniAPYuKfv8iTggjbOJq5AArZTW7aLxY8L2D/woOcl\nZ9C+33VcAtlGCd4fRdSS1DBDgCfAx6XlQK27Dj5JAPiEDXRGcjPgiTgStE9ZLZhq\nqJlYFaSg79WZZuZt9ZWWDFkez82Idz+66wXuJdj9x+R79rt+pD4vEllBoK/xdnYz\njgg+1XZTXrZyGwCKiJRvn1IdfIe4Q/rsW9ZXNlyUOOP3rCQQCV0DLQOcsjuXR3fI\nLUGiVRfIQZEqCtpjFjH10XlV4xwjKssqxneXWA5r4wVWTNTChFYDlTCiU92y0LRm\nb7O8bSl9J9ooT9OL+eTITKj12sTALxtSSD7kD1CSrUh70YGPCtFZtuR05hKmi8Ku\nRnEDFWJn360lfgYoRaOKY6n4IhisHU5p1fE+CSoyRikVgIgoPeBxbgcmLRV+EsOc\nb/YF8J7+0rjj5WZvjIhk\n=A4sl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e7004d39145d4e709cc99982f6d7bec1f2a6c373\nparent 3d89af918ecec9b63f99af92683ee6c477064bd2\nauthor mergify[bot] <37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791330670 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791330670 -0700\n\nDetachableJoint: add initial_attach SDF parameter (#3268) (#4045)\n\nAdd an optional `initial_attach` parameter to the DetachableJoint system\nthat controls whether the joint starts attached or detached when the\nsimulation starts. It defaults to `true`, preserving existing behavior.\n\nThe parameter is read before the attach/detach subscribers are created,\nso an attach request received during startup is not overwritten.\n\nAlso add the InitialAttachFalse integration test and test world models.\n\nCloses #3021\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code (Claude Opus 5.5, Anthropic)\n\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 6501b14956d873409d6945acf7530e3977a94d72)\n\nSigned-off-by: SurafelAnshebo <surafelrtesfaye@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Surafel <25456347+SurafelAnshebo@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Addisu Z. Taddese <addisuzt@intrinsic.ai>","verified_at":"2026-10-06T23:51:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/2cd73296ad1bcbf3d8a2bfec1b45f59e6598638c","html_url":"https://github.com/gazebosim/gz-sim/commit/2cd73296ad1bcbf3d8a2bfec1b45f59e6598638c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gazebosim/gz-sim/commits/2cd73296ad1bcbf3d8a2bfec1b45f59e6598638c/comments","author":{"login":"mergify[bot]","id":37929162,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90Mzc5MjkxNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/10562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/mergify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/followi